WEBVTT

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.920
(crowd shouting indistinctly)

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.960
Grindelwald! Grindelwald!

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.960
(windows thudding)

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.600
(Rosier) No. No!

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.440
(crowd cheering)

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.080
(Vogel) Those people...

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.640
aren't suggesting we listen to
them.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.640
They aren't asking us to listen.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.560
They're demanding it.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.960
You're actually proposing that
that man be allowed to stand?

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.320
Yes.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.320
Yes, let him stand.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.160
(cheering continues)

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.200
Gellert Grindelwald wants
a Muggle-wizard war,

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.200
and if he gets his wish, he
won't just destroy their world,

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.560
he'll destroy ours as well.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.440
Which is why he cannot win.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.520
Let him stand as a candidate.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.280
Let the people vote.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.400
When he loses, the
people will have spoken.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.680
But deny them their voices,

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.320
and those streets
will run with blood.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.440
(fireworks exploding)

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.760
(crowd continues cheering)

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.560
(cheering continues)

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.560
Theseus. (echoing)

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.840
(footsteps patter)

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.560
Theseus.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.200
(faint rustling)

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.280
(soft click)

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.800
(clicking)

00:01:58.240 --> 00:01:59.400
(rustle)

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.040
(clicking)

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.360
(squeaking)

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.360
(screeches)

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.040
(chittering)

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.160
(footsteps pattering)

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.520
(ominous rumbling)

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.080
(creatures chitter)

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.000
(lively chatter)

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:50.440
(classical music playing)

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:53.840
(Lally grunts)

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.280
(Jacob) Lally,

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.400
the guy with the hair...

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.080
sitting next to Edith.

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:17.560
He looks like he can kill somebody.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.120
He also looks like my Uncle
Dominic.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:24.680
Is your Uncle Dominic the
Norwegian Minister of Magic?

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.880
No.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.400
Didn't think so.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.640
(music and chatter stops)

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.560
(gentle classical music playing)

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:56.520
Queenie.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.720
Queenie.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:08.280
Ah.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.400
Madam Santos, a pleasure.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.520
Your supporters are in fine voice.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.880
As are yours, Mr. Grindelwald.

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.960
-(prisoners groaning) -(seething)

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.480
(Newt shuddering)

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.760
(Newt whimpers)

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.360
(Newt huffing)

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.240
Rescuing me, are you?

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.080
-(Newt) That's the general idea.
-(Theseus) Huh.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.600
And I presume this...

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:45.520
whatever it is that you
are doing, is strategic.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.600
Yes, a technique
called limbic mimicry.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.960
It discourages violent
engagement, theoretically.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.520
I've only actually ever
attempted it once before.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.800
-And the results? -Uh...
(panting shakily)

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.120
Inconclusive.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.880
Course that was a laboratory
setting

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:02.280
and the conditions were
strictly controlled, and the...

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.080
Well, the current conditions
are more volatile,

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.080
so making it less predictive
of the ultimate outcome.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.360
The ultimate outcome presumably...

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:13.320
being our survival.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.480
(creature chitters)

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:16.920
(clicking)

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.200
(prisoners groan)

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.640
(seething)

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.080
-(lantern clinks) -(prisoner
screams)

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.720
(hisses)

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.000
(man screaming)

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.200
(screaming continues in distance)

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.400
(Theseus sighs)

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.520
(Theseus groans) Well done, come
on.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:08.520
(Theseus grunts)

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.600
(creatures screeching)

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:11.600
(Theseus sighs)

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.400
And the plan is?

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.600
Hold this.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.440
(plays tune with handflute)

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.440
-(tune echoing) -(snoring)

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:31.680
(whispering) What the
bloody hell was that for?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.280
Um... (breathing shakily)

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:34.920
We're gonna need some help.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.800
(creatures chitter)

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.240
(comical music plays)

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:45.600
Follow me.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.400
Come on.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.160
(comical music continues)

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.280
You're not swiveling properly.

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:03.800
Swivel...

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:05.880
swivel, but delicately.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.920
I'm swiveling like
you're swiveling, Newt.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.560
I don't believe you are.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.040
(lantern clinks)

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.720
(prisoner 2 screams)

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.760
(creature snarls)

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.240
(creatures chittering)

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.120
Swivel.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.680
(melancholy music playing)

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.280
(sniffles)

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:44.120
(whispers) Go to him.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:52.920
Queenie.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:58.880
Tell him it's all right.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.200
I can see he's failed.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.600
He'll have another chance.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.560
It's his loyalty I most value.

